# Claude accounts for `clo -a NAME`. Copy to
#     ${XDG_CONFIG_HOME:-$HOME/.config}/agents-shared/claude-accounts
# and keep it there, untracked.
#
# One line per account: a name, then its Claude config folder (~ allowed). The first
# line is the default account. Blank lines and # comments are skipped.
#
# Naming: the default account keeps ~/.claude; every other account gets
# ~/.claude-<name>, so 1 to 20 accounts sort together and each folder says whose it is.
# Each folder declares its profile in its own paths.local.sh (AGENT_PROFILE=personal or
# work) and is installed separately:
#     CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=~/.claude-<name> bash "$AGENTS_SHARED/scripts/init-global.sh"
#
# name        config folder
personal      ~/.claude
work          ~/.claude-work
